        "## Question 1\n",
        "\n",
        "Create a NumPy array from [10, 20, 30, 40, 50]. Display its shape, size, and data type."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "aafcd325",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "aafcd325"
      },
      "source": [
        "Theory: A NumPy array stores values of a common data type. shape gives dimensions, size gives total elements, and dtype gives the element data type."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 1,
      "id": "791f24ae",
